==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|hvat|lang=is}}, originally the neuter form of {{recons|hver|lang=non}} (from {{proto|gem-pro|hwaz|lang=is}}), but conflated with {{term|hverr|lang=non}} (whence Modern Icelandic {{term|hver|lang=is}}). See {{term|hver|lang=is}}.

